## Diagnosis (this checkout)

1. Hover actions are in-flow (`CalendarView.tsx` ~635–662). That is the size bug in screenshot 1.
2. Copy to already hides when `!dayWorkouts[0]`. New session always on hover. No Notes action.
3. Resting session chip is compact (screenshot 2). Keep that chip; do not restyle it into the overlay.
4. Notes data: set-level `note` only. Architecture §5.1 Workout has no notes field. Sheets Workouts “session notes” is publish prose, not a schema.

