## Acceptance

- [ ] Hovering a day does **not** change that cell’s layout height or the week row vs neighbors; overlay is smaller than today’s full-width `h-7` stack.
- [ ] Empty day hover: New session + Notes. Day with a session: New session + Copy to + Notes.
- [ ] Saving a note shows a **Note** card on that date at rest, distinct from session chips; empty save removes it.
- [ ] Click note card opens Notes editor; click session chip still opens the session.
- [ ] One note per athlete calendar date; no weekday container; no second notes store.
- [ ] Copy to dest click still maps dates (D1 = earliest source date); notes are not copied.
- [ ] Coach follows athlete switcher; no athlete → no overlay. No demo seed; no nested cards; Telegram/Sheets untouched.
- [ ] E2E covers overlay height, three actions, rest card, click vs session, copy D1.

